mediaplace_settings_menu_hint = When enabled, the main "Mediapool" menu item (core addon) opens our overlay picker directly instead of the classic page, and the classic file list is hidden from navigation. The classic subpages (structure, upload, sync) remain reachable via the management icon in the overlay.
