mediaplace_settings_feature_own_metadata_label = Enable own metadata fields
mediaplace_settings_feature_own_metadata_hint = Shows the custom metadata fields configured under MediaPlace → Metainfo Fields in the detail panel (title, system tags and collections are independent of this and always available). Off by default.
mediaplace_settings_feature_alt_missing_filter_label = Show "Media without ALT text" sidebar filter
mediaplace_settings_feature_alt_missing_filter_hint = Shows an entry in the sidebar directly under the Media section that filters all accessible images without ALT text (only visible if an ALT text field – own or classic med_alt – exists at all).
mediaplace_settings_alt_field_legend = Classic ALT text field
mediaplace_settings_alt_field_intro = The classic metainfo field "med_alt" has no way to mark an image as "decorative, no ALT text needed" – an empty field always counts as missing. The additional decorative field lets you exclude such images on purpose.
