mediaplace_settings_feature_tagging_label = Disable tagging (system tags)
mediaplace_settings_feature_tagging_hint = By default, the detail panel shows the system tags field and the sidebar shows the tag filter. Enabling this hides both; existing tags remain stored.
mediaplace_settings_feature_collections_label = Disable collections
mediaplace_settings_feature_collections_hint = By default, the sidebar shows the collections section (create/rename/delete, drag & drop assignment, bookmark button on tiles). Enabling this hides it; existing collection assignments remain stored.
mediaplace_settings_video_thumb_mode_label = Video preview in grid
mediaplace_settings_video_thumb_mode_off = Off (file icon only)
mediaplace_settings_video_thumb_mode_static = Still frame (cheap)
mediaplace_settings_video_thumb_mode_animated = Animated (moving preview, more expensive)
mediaplace_settings_video_thumb_mode_hint = Controls how videos are shown in the grid. "Off" always shows just the file icon (no preview generation). "Still frame" extracts a single still image – notably cheaper than an animated preview, with a small video icon on the tile as a hint. "Animated" is the previous behaviour.
mediaplace_settings_upload_legend = Upload
mediaplace_settings_upload_resize_label = Resize images on upload
mediaplace_settings_upload_resize_hint = Scales images down in the browser to the maximum width/height below before uploading (aspect ratio preserved, smaller images are never enlarged). File format stays unchanged. GIFs and SVGs are never touched (GIFs might be animated, SVGs aren't raster images).
mediaplace_settings_upload_resize_width = Maximum width (px)
mediaplace_settings_upload_resize_height = Maximum height (px)
