mediaplace_settings_upload_provider_builtin = Built-in
mediaplace_settings_upload_provider_hint = Replaces the upload button and drag&drop in the overlay with the selected addon's own dialog – files are handed directly to that dialog instead of the built-in upload.
mediaplace_settings_upload_provider_hint_none = No third-party addon has registered itself as an upload provider – the built-in upload stays active.
