mediaplace_thumb_warmup_background_failed = {0} of {1} thumbnails could not be generated in the background. Usually the server cannot reach its own address ({2}, "server" system setting) – please use "Start in browser" instead.
mediaplace_cronjob_ai_alt_complete_title = MediaPlace: Auto-complete ALT texts
mediaplace_cronjob_ai_alt_complete_batch_size = New ALT texts per run
mediaplace_cronjob_ai_alt_complete_result = {0} of {1} ALT texts completed successfully ({2} failed).
mediaplace_cronjob_ai_alt_complete_disabled = Skipped: automatic completion is not enabled in the settings.
mediaplace_cronjob_ai_alt_complete_unavailable = Skipped: AI ALT text generation is not available.
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_legend = Complete ALT texts
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_intro = Automatically generates and saves AI ALT texts for ALL images missing an ALT text in at least one language – with no review step in between (unlike the bulk generation in the media pool overlay, which shows every suggestion for editing first).
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_cronjob_hint = For an unattended, recurring run there's also the "Auto-complete ALT texts" cronjob type (cronjob management), which processes a configurable batch on a schedule.
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_start_background = Start in background
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_start_browser = Start in browser
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_background_hint = "In background" keeps running server-side even if the tab is closed – reload the page any time to keep watching progress. "In browser" is the fallback if the server can't start background processes (shell_exec disabled).
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_start = Start completion
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_cancel = Cancel
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_progress = Progress
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_errors_title = Failed
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_done = Done – all reachable ALT texts have been completed.
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_disabled_hint = Automatic ALT text completion is disabled. Enable it in the MediaPlace settings ("Auto-complete (no preview)") to use this page.
mediaplace_ai_alt_complete_ai_unavailable_hint = AI ALT text generation is not enabled, or the ai_platform addon is not available.
mediaplace_settings_ai_alt_auto_complete_enable_label = Auto-complete (no preview)
mediaplace_settings_ai_alt_auto_complete_enable_hint = Unlocks the "Complete ALT texts" admin page and the matching cronjob type. Generated texts are saved DIRECTLY there, without an editorial review step first – unlike the bulk generation in the media pool overlay, which shows every suggestion for editing first. Only enable if automatically written texts are acceptable.
