mediaplace_settings_feature_metainfo_editing_hint = Shows a button in the detail panel that makes real med_* fields (created via the Metainfo addon) editable directly in the overlay, via REDAXO's own MEDIA_FORM_EDIT/MEDIA_UPDATED path — no widget system of our own. Relies on a file in the Metainfo addon marked @internal and could break without warning on a Metainfo update.
